.TH "gmnlm" "1" "2026-04-09"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
gmnlm \- Gemini line-mode browser
.PP
.SH SYNPOSIS
.PP
\fBgmnlm\fR [-PU] [-j \fImode\fR] [-W \fIwidth\fR] \fIgemini://.\&.\&.\&\fR
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBgmnlm\fR is an interactive line-mode Gemini browser.\&
.PP
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB-j\fR \fImode\fR
.RS 4
Sets the TOFU (trust on first use) configuration, which controls if the
client shall trust new certificates.\& \fImode\fR can be one of \fBalways\fR,
\fBonce\fR, or \fBfail\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-P\fR
.RS 4
Disable pagination.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-U\fR
.RS 4
Disable conservative use of Unicode symbols to render Gemini layout
features.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-W\fR \fIwidth\fR
.RS 4
Sets the maximum width, in columns, of Gemtext pages.\&
.RE
